5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! This is going to be so much fun! I wonder who the werewolf is?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,Let's stay calm and observe everyone's behavior. We need a logical approach to find the wolf.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in what people say.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm not afraid of any wolf! I'll find them and protect everyone!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll just listen for now.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi is so energetic! It's almost suspicious, don't you think? Hehe!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"It's too early to make accusations, Sakura. We have no information yet.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Victoria,,True. Any early claim could be a bluff by the werewolf or the possessed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Hey! I'm just being honest! @Sakura, stop teasing me!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,pass,Misaki,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm just playing! But maybe the Seer should tell us something soon?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,The Seer won't reveal themselves immediately; it would make them a target.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Victoria,,Exactly. The Seer needs to gather information quietly first.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I guess that makes sense. I'll keep my eyes open.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
