31,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning everyone! Did anyone have any scary dreams?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I have some information. I am the Seer, and I divined Sakura. She is the werewolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"That was fast. Minako, are you certain? Or are you trying to draw the wolf out?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"What?! Sakura is the wolf? No way, she's just a kid!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Misaki,,It's a bold claim. But Minako is usually very reliable.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Eh?! Me?! Minako-san, that's a mean lie! I'm just a normal girl!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minako,,I don't lie about these things. The result was clear.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, your reaction is quite emotional. @Misaki, what do you think?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I don't know... Sakura seems too cheerful to be a wolf.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"It's hard to tell. But if Minako is the Seer, we have to trust her.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Sakura,,Please believe me! Minako-san is just mistaken! I'm not the werewolf!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minako,,The divination is absolute. There is no mistake.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"If Minako is lying, she's either the wolf or the possessed. But her timing is very efficient.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I still feel bad about it, but if the Seer says so...","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm leaning towards voting for Sakura.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Nooo! This is a nightmare!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minako,,Let's vote.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. The evidence from the Seer is the strongest lead we have.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"Fine. Sorry, Sakura.","{""words"":3,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm ready.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
